    {
      "id": "fa18-ufc",
      "name": "UFC",
      "display": "UFC1",
      "fields": [
        {
          "cells": "0",
          "source": "UFC_SCRATCHPAD_STRING_1_DISPLAY",
          "note": "Two characters into one cell. A digit keeps its leading space, which selects the small form the hardware was observed being sent. A letter has no spaced form, so ' G' falls back to 'G'."
        },
        {
          "cells": "1",
          "source": "UFC_SCRATCHPAD_STRING_2_DISPLAY",
          "aliases": {
            "--": "_"
          },
          "note": "DCS-BIOS reports '--' where DCS's own indication says '_', and '--' is not a glyph. Without the alias this cell draws a single dash."
        },
        {
          "cells": "2-8",
          "content": [
            {
              "source": "UFC_SCRATCHPAD_NUMBER_DISPLAY",
              "width": 7,
              "align": "right"
            }
          ],
          "note": "DCS-BIOS gives 8 characters for 7 cells, so one of them cannot be shown. Held to 7 and aligned right, which drops the leading pad rather than a digit and lands keypresses at the right. Written as a box rather than as a field alignment because it says out loud that a character goes, so the editor stops warning that one might."
        },
        {
          "cells": "9",
          "source": "UFC_OPTION_CUEING_1"
        },
        {
          "cells": "10-13",
          "source": "UFC_OPTION_DISPLAY_1"
        },
